{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "37f93a070955b889",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -230,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# Econometrics\n\nOne loop, repeated everywhere:\n\n**define a population quantity \u2192 build a sample analog \u2192 work out how far off it is \u2192 ask whether it answers your question.**\n\nThe last step is identification. It is where causal claims live or die.\n\nStart at **01**, then **04**. Cross into causality at **10**."
    },
